{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30370769"}, "name":{"label":"ybrick"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-03-03T07:17:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"5611081866"}, "title":{"label":"Free apps that do the same thing"}, "content":{"label":"Didn’t see the big deal.  There are plenty of free apps out there that offer sounds.  I paid for the app and was given a few sounds.  However, you have to subscribe to get features and full accessibility.  Not worth it.  Regret paying for the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id516531961"}, "name":{"label":"VictoriaSilvis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-02-27T09:34:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"5588347800"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app yet this app needs app blocker"}, "content":{"label":"I am impressed how simple this app to use. Not like other applications this is far more simpler to use, you do not need an account to sign up, all you need is to pay for the app which is not  too expensive. I’m not big fan of subscriptions because other developers is making others pay per month. Why not per year? \nPeople has to continue working to make money. \n\nAlso as for your extension, I was kind of feeling disappointed because you’re doing subscriptions too, as long you are not demanding for money. For the rational reason I think your doing this to keep your applications from having any problems, especially from us customers using your app. \n\nAs customer of these applications, instead of pressuring the developers to push themselves to work hard. Work smart than hard because it will be difficult to tackle onto difficult tasks, although I suggest breaking down the difficult tasks into steps to complete a harder task to improve this application. \n\nOne more thing before I go. Do you mind adding an app blocker to keep myself and others from being distracted? Since social media, and the internet is source of my distractions I’m mostly on my iPad than my laptop. I think it would be smart if you add an app blocker, since I already paid for this when I got the app. Could you add the app blocker for people who already paid for the app?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28970227"}, "name":{"label":"didaskala"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-02-25T05:19:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"5578548926"}, "title":{"label":"Not consistent"}, "content":{"label":"The worst part about this app is that it does not resume after anything else happens on my iPhone. Apple Music always does but this does not. It’s super annoying to have to go back into this app and restart over and over. Developers need to change this. Otherwise the app is great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
